    "updated_at": "2025-10-16T10:37:44Z",
    "body": "I am wondering if Steps 11~16 are needed, or perhaps explain why we already know there's an error to rethrow in step 10, but ignore that. In that case, should the spec clear the error to rethrow after we call _FinishLoadingImportedModule_?",
